sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Graner & Glazier (1992) / Glazier & Graner (1993) extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model cell sorting — MorphoEval overall 54.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) evaluation of `1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py` (56.8/100). The v1 baseline implements the Graner & Glazier (1992) 2D extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model (CPM) Hamiltonian and surface tensions gamma_LD, gamma_LM, gamma_DM for canonical complete sorting (`0 < gamma_LD < gamma_DM - gamma_LM`) plus an equal-adhesion negative control (`gamma_LD = 0`), but omits the remaining three canonical phase regimes (partial sorting / lens formation `gamma_LD > |gamma_LM - gamma_DM|`, checkerboard mixing `gamma_LD < 0`, and cell dissociation `gamma_LM < 0`), omits Glazier & Graner's (1993) zero-temperature `T = 0` lattice pinning arrest vs high-temperature `T >> J` thermal melting controls, does not load or segment the vendored confocal embryonic cell aggregate specimen (`embryonic_cell_aggregate_specimen.jpg`), and exposes no CLI parameter flags beyond `--self-test`. Overall 54.3/100 (faithfulness 49.2, reproducibility 66.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 67, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 45, Morphometric validation 52, Source and data traceability 64, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 67. Output judged: docs/media/cellular_potts_cell_sorting_comparison.png: rendered output of 1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py at b9976f8, image/png, 66410 B, 1430×494 px, artifact_sha256 b3ded3b1b7a92e2f9206bc3251afdf0f0f31bff3b9a80e60a5da45a5baa1c475 (sha256 b3ded3b1b7a92e2f9206bc3251afdf0f0f31bff3b9a80e60a5da45a5baa1c475), spec_fingerprint 7cdd3f38f0e6192e614f25f3f47d81cb4d09870705b0e0dca1d1d4dbca9f4cc0. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 7cdd3f38f0e6192e614f25f3f47d81cb4d09870705b0e0dca1d1d4dbca9f4cc0; artifact_sha256: b3ded3b1b7a92e2f9206bc3251afdf0f0f31bff3b9a80e60a5da45a5baa1c475." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Implement Glazier & Graner (1993) Section III.B fluctuation temperature controls comparing zero-temperature `T = 0` lattice pinning arrest, optimal `T = 10` thermal sorting with logarithmic boundary decay `L_het(t) ~ A - B ln(t)` (Graner & Glazier 1992 Fig. 3), and high-temperature `T = 80` thermal melting.",
            "remediation needed: Load and SHA-256-verify `datasets/cellular_potts_cell_sorting/cellular_potts_cell_sorting_reference.json` and `embryonic_cell_aggregate_specimen.jpg`, segment the inner GFP-positive dark-type bolus and outer polygonal RFP-outlined light-type tissue matrix, compare empirical vs. simulated radial density profiles (Pearson r and RMSE), and expose full CLI flags.",
            "remediation needed: Simulate all 4 canonical thermodynamic phase regimes of Graner & Glazier (1992) / Glazier & Graner (1993) (`complete_sorting_engulfment` 0 < gamma_LD < gamma_DM - gamma_LM, `partial_sorting_lens` gamma_LD > |gamma_LM - gamma_DM|, `checkerboard_mixing` gamma_LD < 0, and `cell_dissociation` gamma_LM < 0) plus the equal-adhesion negative control (`gamma_LD = 0`) and a 7-point continuous J_LD sweep across both phase boundaries." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.543"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

